{"steam_appid":3710840,"steam_name":"House Flipper Remastered Collection","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3710840/1371207645/308d29356c760216a31585ac1f5a46ca3195c1a1/1780562121/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780584108","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257350138/b6369d154fa682b59c77fa928ffc6f7633131e8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780584108","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/a8e142f91b17b0e91032b0f0d9efd1c3b90a318f/ss_a8e142f91b17b0e91032b0f0d9efd1c3b90a318f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786634959","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/eacd8f2eee2a4b98a1627a3518d5676194996b5d/ss_eacd8f2eee2a4b98a1627a3518d5676194996b5d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786634959","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/aa0f16603b067fab7a293633999594725cd10b6c/ss_aa0f16603b067fab7a293633999594725cd10b6c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786634959","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/7e492b298321e8ed85a539856f1f860bca3c9569/ss_7e492b298321e8ed85a539856f1f860bca3c9569.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786634959","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/87ee6fb2aca54f6baeaf1e6c8ae1ce4afd1f53e6/ss_87ee6fb2aca54f6baeaf1e6c8ae1ce4afd1f53e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786634959"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/013a3a2e22696c23cc144159acca8973.avif?t=1786634959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras_big/013a3a2e22696c23cc144159acca8973.avif?t=1786634959 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>RENOVATION NEVER LOOKED SO GOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Flipper Remastered Collection is your upgraded ticket to the satisfying world of renovation chaos. Step into the boots of a one-person crew and transform those filthy, devastated properties into real gems. Now with better visuals, voice acting, and fresh content – it’s flipping, just way better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/d57bc1926052d4d7576dc0e60824d84d.poster.avif?t=1786634959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/d57bc1926052d4d7576dc0e60824d84d.webm?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/d57bc1926052d4d7576dc0e60824d84d.mp4?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REVAMPED STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new faces, enjoy full voice acting, and follow a reimagined narrative that adds charm and character to every mission. Renovating has never felt so personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/2ce8dbea6ddb6d221354d0374bff79a2.poster.avif?t=1786634959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/2ce8dbea6ddb6d221354d0374bff79a2.webm?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/2ce8dbea6ddb6d221354d0374bff79a2.mp4?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>MEANING OF LOVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know new stories, crafted specially for the new, fresh House Flipper. In this cozy chaos, be a witness to different types of love. Help newlyweds renovate their own place, or help someone express their love for coffee truly! Expect charming characters, emotional twists, and homes that come with a story… And maybe a spark or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9119780601102afcccbb54b9e595bc98.poster.avif?t=1786634959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9119780601102afcccbb54b9e595bc98.webm?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9119780601102afcccbb54b9e595bc98.mp4?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK SMARTER NOT HARDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know that time is money in the flipping business. That’s why we’ve introduced massive Quality of Life improvements to streamline your hard work. Say goodbye to tedious tasks with the new area cleanup and multi-block demolition mechanics. Now you can pull weeds, gather trash, and smash through entire walls in seconds. Less grind means more time to focus on the most satisfying parts of your renovation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9c4a8fee6cef22e3c7f78c8e1e74b146.poster.avif?t=1786634959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9c4a8fee6cef22e3c7f78c8e1e74b146.webm?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/9c4a8fee6cef22e3c7f78c8e1e74b146.mp4?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 DLCs IN ONE PACKAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to flipping or returning for more? You’re in for a treat. House Flipper Remaster bundles 10 previous expansions in one ultimate edition, making it the most complete version of the game to date. Everything’s here – now it’s your turn to make it beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/45e6245d7f9028256c750f7f086b8ad2.poster.avif?t=1786634959\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/45e6245d7f9028256c750f7f086b8ad2.webm?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710840/extras/45e6245d7f9028256c750f7f086b8ad2.mp4?t=1786634959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later versions, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 6500 8GB | NVIDIA GTX 1660 or equivalent performance &amp; VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SATA SSD</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 or later versions, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 9600k | AMD Ryzen 5 5600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8GBs VRAM | NVIDIA RTX-2070 | AMD Radeon RX 6700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> VME SSD</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Frozen Way"],"publishers":["Frozen Way","Frozen District"],"release_date":"Jun 4, 2026"}